# Lecture 8

### Course Properties

---

## properties.yaml

- Course credits and attribution
- Companion links (Slack, Moodle, YouTube)
- Authentication settings
- Calendar configuration

---

## Customisation

- Custom icons from Iconify
- Parent course linking
- Topic show/hide with PIN
- Portfolio mode

---

## Summary

The properties.yaml file provides extensive customisation options for tailoring the course experience.
